WEBVTT

00:02:06.220 --> 00:02:10.400
Saint Seiya

00:03:23.310 --> 00:03:29.980
The Warrior from Ancient Times

00:03:55.540 --> 00:03:57.210
Here I come, Shion.

00:03:57.350 --> 00:03:58.800
Come, Dohko.

00:04:18.660 --> 00:04:20.280
The battle is decided.

00:04:20.550 --> 00:04:21.690
What?

00:04:21.990 --> 00:04:26.980
I thought a Thousand Day War was inevitable.

00:04:27.630 --> 00:04:33.600
We're equally matched and
our fights never end.

00:04:34.250 --> 00:04:36.180
But Dohko,

00:04:36.250 --> 00:04:41.660
the passing of 243 years
has revealed the winner.

00:04:41.810 --> 00:04:43.130
What did you say?

00:04:52.220 --> 00:04:53.990
That's Old Master.

00:04:54.160 --> 00:04:56.150
In the direction of the House of Aries. No...

00:04:56.650 --> 00:05:01.360
From a slightly different location,
I feel Old Master's powerful Cosmo.

00:05:01.550 --> 00:05:06.440
And another Cosmo as
powerful as Old Master's.

00:05:06.640 --> 00:05:08.060
What's going on?

00:05:08.410 --> 00:05:09.460
Could it be?

00:05:18.680 --> 00:05:22.120
Seiya, go ahead to Athena.

00:05:22.240 --> 00:05:25.600
But Shiryu, I can't let you go alone.

00:05:25.600 --> 00:05:27.430
Don't worry about me.

00:05:31.380 --> 00:05:35.940
You would do the same for Marin.

00:05:36.150 --> 00:05:39.890
That's true. Then I'll go with you.

00:05:39.890 --> 00:05:40.610
Seiya.

00:05:42.250 --> 00:05:45.780
Athena, Miss Saori is waiting for you.

00:05:46.880 --> 00:05:47.930
Shiryu.

00:05:48.340 --> 00:05:51.380
Go, Seiya. I'll follow right behind you.

00:05:51.890 --> 00:05:53.980
All right, I'll be waiting.

00:06:00.720 --> 00:06:06.770
Watching over Athena's seal that
contained the 108 Evil Stars.

00:06:06.770 --> 00:06:09.020
You've grown old, Dohko.

00:06:09.290 --> 00:06:12.150
You don't have the strength of your youth!

00:06:14.790 --> 00:06:19.510
But I have the youth given
to me by Lord Hades.

00:06:19.750 --> 00:06:24.320
The invincibility and power
of an eighteen-year-old body.

00:06:33.440 --> 00:06:37.960
Dohko, there is no victory
for an old man like you!

00:06:54.830 --> 00:06:58.820
Old Master, I'm sorry to arrive so late.

00:07:00.200 --> 00:07:01.280
You are...

00:07:01.390 --> 00:07:03.930
Let me be his opponent.

00:07:10.460 --> 00:07:11.490
Old Master.

00:07:12.280 --> 00:07:18.600
I told Shunrei to never let
you leave Five Ancient Peaks.

00:07:18.800 --> 00:07:22.650
Why did you come here with your blind self?

00:07:24.450 --> 00:07:26.690
I order you as your master.

00:07:26.850 --> 00:07:30.520
Shiryu, leave this place immediately.

00:07:30.680 --> 00:07:32.210
I cannot, Old Master.

00:07:34.060 --> 00:07:36.940
You have a good student, Dohko.

00:07:37.110 --> 00:07:42.230
That's fine, I'll bury you both.

00:07:42.420 --> 00:07:43.300
What?

00:07:43.300 --> 00:07:46.910
Wait, Shiryu. Stay out of this.

00:07:47.710 --> 00:07:53.740
Shion is the true Pope who
died in battle with Saga.

00:07:53.820 --> 00:07:55.430
What? That means.

00:07:55.910 --> 00:08:02.440
The one who fought and survived the
last holy war with me, Aries Shion.

00:08:03.180 --> 00:08:07.990
He is the master of Mu.

00:08:08.930 --> 00:08:11.930
Mu? Then why is he...

00:08:12.250 --> 00:08:19.870
Shion, are you content with
the fake life, the fake youth?

00:08:19.870 --> 00:08:20.340
What?

00:08:20.740 --> 00:08:25.990
We only get one life, one chance to live.

00:08:26.100 --> 00:08:32.740
Don't you think that makes it precious?

00:08:33.230 --> 00:08:38.540
You have a point, but I don't
have the patience to listen.

00:08:38.660 --> 00:08:40.600
I'll finish you, take this!

00:08:42.070 --> 00:08:47.390
When I think a man like you has
succumbed to the lust of life,

00:08:47.920 --> 00:08:50.440
it makes me sad, Shion.

00:08:50.940 --> 00:08:52.890
Dohko, you...

00:08:53.020 --> 00:08:56.740
Die here and return to the old Shion.

00:09:01.000 --> 00:09:04.110
Rising Hundred Dragons!

00:09:05.020 --> 00:09:06.390
Crystal Wall!

00:09:06.610 --> 00:09:13.060
It's no use. Even the Crystal Wall
can't stop Rising Hundred Dragons.

00:09:13.060 --> 00:09:13.520
What?

00:09:18.200 --> 00:09:20.040
What a mess.

00:09:20.100 --> 00:09:22.200
Stop, it's useless.

00:09:22.200 --> 00:09:23.890
But, Shina.

00:09:23.990 --> 00:09:29.350
Next time we see a Silver Saint,
we have no choice but to fight.

00:09:30.060 --> 00:09:35.190
Fine by me. I'll take down
whoever attacks the Sanctuary.

00:09:35.190 --> 00:09:36.680
Shina!

00:09:39.950 --> 00:09:41.860
What happened?

00:09:42.620 --> 00:09:49.500
Babel, Moses, Misty. Those I
saw in Siberia weren't fake.

00:09:50.050 --> 00:09:51.450
They attacked you too?

00:09:51.450 --> 00:09:54.730
Hyoga, Shun. What are you here to do?

00:09:55.080 --> 00:09:56.940
You heard Athena's orders.

00:09:57.360 --> 00:09:58.410
Shina!

00:09:58.870 --> 00:10:02.380
Athena's orders are absolute.
Get them out of here.

00:10:02.620 --> 00:10:03.930
Out of here?

00:10:05.240 --> 00:10:07.510
If you insist on fighting...

00:10:10.040 --> 00:10:10.750
Nice!

00:10:16.720 --> 00:10:20.550
Impossible. He's still standing after
taking the Rising Hundred Dragon.

00:10:21.040 --> 00:10:25.310
Shion, does Old Master's
attack have no effect?

00:10:25.390 --> 00:10:28.990
Dohko, you have definitely aged.

00:10:28.990 --> 00:10:35.910
If you had your previous power, I
would have been done by that one blow.

00:10:36.010 --> 00:10:36.970
However.

00:10:40.870 --> 00:10:47.400
Did he expel all the damage caused
by the Rising Hundred Dragon?

00:10:47.400 --> 00:10:53.370
Shion, you possess the invincibility
of your youthful past.

00:10:53.370 --> 00:10:57.140
Is this the power of Lord Hades?

00:11:00.950 --> 00:11:03.930
Dohko, surrender and die!

00:11:04.110 --> 00:11:04.650
Hmm?

00:11:05.370 --> 00:11:06.800
What's this Cosmo?

00:11:06.950 --> 00:11:10.210
Dohko, you must also be aware,

00:11:10.210 --> 00:11:15.060
if you get caught up in this
stardust, you cannot escape.

00:11:15.060 --> 00:11:17.050
Die, Dohko!

00:11:22.700 --> 00:11:25.820
Stardust Revolution!

00:11:29.370 --> 00:11:30.380
Old Master!

00:11:34.040 --> 00:11:37.190
Old Master, get a hold
of yourself. Old Master!

00:11:37.580 --> 00:11:38.610
You're in the way.

00:11:48.800 --> 00:11:52.590
Don't worry, I'll bury you soon.

00:11:55.200 --> 00:11:57.950
Once I chop off Dohko's head.

00:11:58.610 --> 00:11:59.450
Wait.

00:12:08.220 --> 00:12:11.200
I won't let you take Old Master's head.

00:12:11.350 --> 00:12:17.230
Not only are you blind, but your Cloth
is tattered. What can you do about it?

00:12:17.390 --> 00:12:20.220
I will fight, of course. For justice!

00:12:20.550 --> 00:12:21.300
Take this.

00:12:21.560 --> 00:12:23.900
Rising Dragon!

00:12:24.800 --> 00:12:28.190
Stop, Hyoga. Shina isn't the enemy.

00:12:28.190 --> 00:12:29.350
But, Shun.

00:12:29.350 --> 00:12:32.480
Athena doesn't want us to fight anymore.

00:12:33.400 --> 00:12:34.480
Right?

00:12:35.660 --> 00:12:38.610
It's Athena, Miss Saori's kindness.

00:12:38.610 --> 00:12:40.320
That's why she's keeping us out?

00:12:42.010 --> 00:12:48.660
I'm grateful for Athena's consideration,
but that's why we have to fight.

00:12:50.220 --> 00:12:52.550
Honestly, I don't like fighting.

00:12:53.220 --> 00:12:56.840
But what I hate most, more than getting hurt,

00:12:57.040 --> 00:13:00.120
is leaving Athena in danger
while we do nothing.

00:13:00.120 --> 00:13:05.070
That's 100 times more worse.

00:13:05.730 --> 00:13:10.240
We are Saints. We fight to live.

00:13:10.240 --> 00:13:12.950
That's right. It's just not me and you.

00:13:12.950 --> 00:13:16.810
Brother, Seiya and Shiryu
must think the same.

00:13:20.540 --> 00:13:25.690
You're serious? You're seriously
disobeying Athena's orders?

00:13:28.000 --> 00:13:28.700
Shina.

00:13:34.210 --> 00:13:35.060
Take this!

00:13:35.060 --> 00:13:37.480
Rising Dragon!

00:13:39.850 --> 00:13:40.450
What?

00:13:41.830 --> 00:13:45.680
Why are you surprised?

00:13:46.790 --> 00:13:50.750
You caught the Rising Dragon with one hand.

00:13:50.810 --> 00:13:53.480
That's the difference between us.

00:13:53.580 --> 00:13:59.690
You Bronze Saints are becoming
an eyesore. I'll bury you first.

00:14:01.020 --> 00:14:02.240
Wait.

00:14:02.440 --> 00:14:03.160
Old Master!

00:14:08.220 --> 00:14:12.870
Shiryu, I told you to stay out of this.

00:14:13.330 --> 00:14:14.250
However...

00:14:14.900 --> 00:14:17.470
Return to Five Ancient Peaks.

00:14:26.320 --> 00:14:29.090
I cannot turn a blind eye

00:14:29.320 --> 00:14:35.880
when you, Seiya and the others are fighting.

00:14:35.880 --> 00:14:40.320
I rather choose to die fighting.

00:14:40.320 --> 00:14:43.790
That is my way.

00:14:45.320 --> 00:14:49.540
You are so stubborn.

00:14:50.680 --> 00:14:56.020
Well, that is your weakness and strength.

00:14:56.140 --> 00:14:57.210
Old Master.

00:14:59.860 --> 00:15:04.810
All right, Shiryu. I will apologize
to Athena on your behalf.

00:15:06.480 --> 00:15:07.500
Old Master.

00:15:10.160 --> 00:15:14.150
Shall we die together, Shiryu?

00:15:14.630 --> 00:15:15.840
It is my honor.

00:15:16.420 --> 00:15:21.200
You are such an unreasonable man.

00:15:27.920 --> 00:15:29.050
Hyoga.

00:15:29.780 --> 00:15:31.330
I have no choice.

00:16:04.200 --> 00:16:05.560
Shina.

00:16:06.100 --> 00:16:11.020
Hurry, while I have my
back turned towards you.

00:16:14.240 --> 00:16:15.210
Thank you.

00:16:15.470 --> 00:16:18.080
The enemy is strong. Be careful.

00:16:18.520 --> 00:16:19.620
We'll be on our way.

00:16:25.490 --> 00:16:29.120
I won't forgive you if you're
defeated by anyone other than me.

00:16:31.180 --> 00:16:32.590
They're burning.

00:16:33.820 --> 00:16:38.870
Their hearts, they melted mine.

00:16:41.090 --> 00:16:45.330
Dohko, have you bid your
precious student farewell?

00:16:45.680 --> 00:16:51.610
Then I will send both of you to the
Underworld, to Lord Hades's realm!

00:16:52.490 --> 00:16:54.930
Keep calm, Shiryu.

00:16:55.600 --> 00:16:58.540
Shion, you can't defeat me.

00:16:58.710 --> 00:17:02.910
You old man, your head's barely attached
to your body by leathery skin.

00:17:03.200 --> 00:17:04.990
What are you talking about?

00:17:07.790 --> 00:17:08.660
What?

00:17:10.600 --> 00:17:11.300
This is...

00:17:12.920 --> 00:17:16.960
The Libra Cloth! It's transformed
into a shield to protect us.

00:17:17.830 --> 00:17:21.730
Dohko, you've been saved by your Cloth.

00:17:22.050 --> 00:17:28.570
It's disheartening. The Libra
Cloth is useless to you.

00:17:28.720 --> 00:17:33.150
You cannot bear the Cloth on your weary body.

00:17:33.220 --> 00:17:36.220
You will be thrashed by
the force of the Cloth.

00:17:36.730 --> 00:17:38.570
Do you think so?

00:17:38.710 --> 00:17:40.650
This is unbearable.

00:17:41.020 --> 00:17:43.300
Now, this is it.

00:17:43.410 --> 00:17:47.140
Nothing can keep you from death!

00:17:47.350 --> 00:17:48.290
Die!

00:17:48.530 --> 00:17:50.030
Stardust Revolu...

00:17:57.420 --> 00:18:03.690
What is this Cosmo emanating
from Dohko's near dead body?

00:18:08.030 --> 00:18:13.710
And it's not the aged Cosmo
I felt before. This is...

00:18:16.850 --> 00:18:23.180
This is the Cosmo of Dohko in his peak

00:18:23.180 --> 00:18:27.390
when he was 18.

00:18:27.980 --> 00:18:33.580
Shion, why do you think for 243 years

00:18:33.580 --> 00:18:37.720
I sat under the waterfall
at Five Ancient Peaks?

00:18:38.040 --> 00:18:38.840
What?

00:18:41.360 --> 00:18:49.850
I'll show you why the Libra
Cloth flew here right now.

00:18:56.090 --> 00:18:58.270
What? What is this?

00:19:09.870 --> 00:19:12.630
What is this Cosmo full of vigor?

00:19:16.180 --> 00:19:19.580
Old Master has become young. What's going on?

00:19:19.760 --> 00:19:24.890
What's happening before my eyes?
What happened to Old Master's body?

00:19:26.050 --> 00:19:31.860
There's no doubt. Right now you are
the young Gold Saint of your past.

00:19:32.050 --> 00:19:33.780
Libra Dohko.

00:19:34.720 --> 00:19:37.080
Shion, listen!

00:19:38.110 --> 00:19:41.040
I was given a power greater than Athena.

00:19:41.340 --> 00:19:44.070
The power of Misopethamenos.

00:19:44.070 --> 00:19:49.410
Misopethamenos? The state
of suspended life of God?

00:19:53.140 --> 00:19:57.800
Two hundred forty-three years ago,
when the war with Hades was over,

00:19:58.420 --> 00:20:04.580
Athena gave us, the only survivors, a
mission to prepare for the next holy war.

00:20:05.960 --> 00:20:09.900
Shion, you protected the
Sanctuary as the Pope.

00:20:10.180 --> 00:20:16.240
And I guarded the tower that
contained 108 Evil Stars.

00:20:18.120 --> 00:20:24.460
Since then, my heart only
beat 100,000 times a year.

00:20:25.320 --> 00:20:26.160
What?

00:20:26.260 --> 00:20:31.800
Impossible, that's how many times
a human heart beats in a day.

00:20:31.800 --> 00:20:32.830
That means...

00:20:33.170 --> 00:20:37.160
That means 243 years

00:20:37.160 --> 00:20:43.390
was only 243 days for my body.

00:20:45.410 --> 00:20:46.540
I see.

00:20:46.850 --> 00:20:48.340
That's why Old Master sat

00:20:48.430 --> 00:20:54.740
beneath the waterfall in rain or wind.

00:20:54.980 --> 00:21:01.240
He was watching over Athena's tower
with his body in suspended animation.

00:21:01.390 --> 00:21:02.310
Shiryu.

00:21:02.810 --> 00:21:03.320
Yes.

00:21:03.860 --> 00:21:08.860
What are you doing? I said
I will apologize to Athena.

00:21:08.950 --> 00:21:12.230
Follow after Mu and defeat the enemy.

00:21:12.230 --> 00:21:12.910
Yes!

00:21:13.340 --> 00:21:15.250
I warn you.

00:21:15.600 --> 00:21:19.750
Saga and the others aren't the
only intruders in the 12 houses.

00:21:20.090 --> 00:21:24.040
Several of Hades' Specters are there too.

00:21:24.380 --> 00:21:28.840
Listen, Shiryu, don't
leave any Specter alive.

00:21:29.090 --> 00:21:31.530
Protect Athena even if you die.

00:21:31.630 --> 00:21:33.090
Yes, Old Master!

00:21:33.940 --> 00:21:35.530
Don't move!

00:21:39.330 --> 00:21:42.360
You're the one who can't move, Shion.

00:21:55.660 --> 00:22:02.180
Dohko, you bear the Cloth for
the first time in 243 years.

00:22:02.790 --> 00:22:05.880
Now, Shion, we are equally matched.

00:22:06.220 --> 00:22:08.120
Just like back then.

00:22:08.730 --> 00:22:14.310
Fine. That way I can kill
you without reservation.

00:22:14.590 --> 00:22:20.910
I hope it's not just
appearances, I'll find out!

00:22:20.910 --> 00:22:21.850
Dohko!

00:22:26.700 --> 00:22:31.030
How is it, Shion? Can you stop the force now?

00:22:32.040 --> 00:22:35.930
His power has also revived.

00:22:36.250 --> 00:22:42.380
However, Dohko. At this rate, we'll
fall into the feared situation.

00:22:46.450 --> 00:22:50.260
How powerful! This is Old
Master's true strength.

00:22:50.410 --> 00:22:54.150
Now that we're equally matched,

00:22:54.170 --> 00:22:58.080
will we fall into a Thousand Day War?

00:22:58.430 --> 00:23:01.730
Or will we both die? It's one or the other.

00:23:02.120 --> 00:23:07.280
Shiryu, I'll teach the final attack.
It's all I can do for you now.

00:23:07.630 --> 00:23:08.570
Final?

00:23:08.920 --> 00:23:11.730
I'll only do it once. Watch carefully.

00:23:16.930 --> 00:23:18.200
What's he doing now?

00:23:18.530 --> 00:23:20.860
I'll take him down before that!

00:23:22.370 --> 00:23:25.780
Fool, do you choose death, Shion?

00:23:25.850 --> 00:23:28.710
Stardust Revolution!

00:23:28.710 --> 00:23:31.170
Rising Hundred Dragons!

00:23:43.610 --> 00:23:46.650
The dragons fly up into the night sky!

00:23:57.520 --> 00:23:59.500
Farewell, Shiryu.

00:24:15.470 --> 00:24:16.630
What?

00:24:17.830 --> 00:24:19.200
What's this aura?

00:24:28.790 --> 00:24:30.750
My master, Shion.

00:24:59.060 --> 00:25:04.060
Their Cosmos disappeared.

00:26:29.700 --> 00:26:32.250
The Underworld's reach has
extended to the House of Cancer

00:26:32.430 --> 00:26:34.060
and now the House of Leo.

00:26:34.310 --> 00:26:36.490
They are closer than ever to reaching Athena.

00:26:37.260 --> 00:26:41.350
Mu, Shaka, don't let them through!

00:26:41.500 --> 00:26:43.450
We'll join you soon.

00:26:44.510 --> 00:26:48.680
Saint Seiya, The Herd of Black
Cloaks, The Moment of Vacillation.

00:26:49.260 --> 00:26:52.100
Do you sense the Cosmo?
